261011 08:59:44[0.9.7_00000000000000][core.providers.tts.google_tts]-INFO-Google TTS first audio after 0.300s: Once upon a time
261011 08:59:44[0.9.7_00000000000000][core.providers.tts.google_tts]-INFO-Google TTS first audio after 0.233s: high above a misty valley, there lived a small dragon named Ember
261011 08:59:45[0.9.7_00000000000000][core.providers.tts.google_tts]-INFO-Google TTS first audio after 0.150s: Unlike the other dragons, Ember couldn't breathe fire
261011 08:59:45[0.9.7_00000000000000][core.providers.tts.google_tts]-INFO-Google TTS first audio after 0.221s: When she sneezed, only a puff of warm, glittering smoke came out
261011 08:59:46[0.9.7_00000000000000][core.providers.tts.google_tts]-INFO-Google TTS first audio after 0.190s: The older dragons laughed, so Ember spent her days alone, collecting shiny buttons, spoons and bits of glass from the village below
261011 08:59:47[0.9.7_00000000000000][core.providers.tts.google_tts]-INFO-Google TTS first audio after 0.244s: One bitter winter, a snowstorm buried the valley
261011 08:59:48[0.9.7_00000000000000][core.providers.tts.google_tts]-INFO-Google TTS first audio after 0.244s: The village lamps went out, and the villagers huddled in the cold, afraid
261011 08:59:49[0.9.7_00000000000000][core.providers.tts.google_tts]-INFO-Google TTS first audio after 0.198s: Ember saw the dark village from her cave and felt her heart thump
261011 08:59:50[0.9.7_00000000000000][core.providers.tts.google_tts]-INFO-Google TTS first audio after 0.304s: She flew down, landed in the square, and sneezed as hard as she could
261011 08:59:51[0.9.7_00000000000000][core.providers.tts.google_tts]-INFO-Google TTS first audio after 0.343s: Out came a cloud of warm, golden smoke
261011 08:59:52[0.9.7_00000000000000][core.providers.tts.google_tts]-INFO-Google TTS first audio after 0.232s: It drifted into every window and chimney, and wherever it touched, the air grew cozy
261011 08:59:52[0.9.7_00000000000000][core.providers.tts.google_tts]-INFO-Google TTS first audio after 0.207s: Shall I go on?
